WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:03.332
Unit seventeen. Dengue in the Community!

2
00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:08.388
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.438 --> 00:00:11.434
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:15.352
Today we learn about Dengue in the Community. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:19.027
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

6
00:00:22.545 --> 00:00:26.245
Aedes mosquito. Say it with me. Aedes mosquito!

7
00:00:29.735 --> 00:00:33.502
Breeding site. Say it with me. Breeding site!

8
00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:40.427
Larvae. Say it with me. Larvae!

9
00:00:43.881 --> 00:00:47.331
Community. Say it with me. Community!

10
00:00:50.815 --> 00:00:53.965
Clean-up. Say it with me. Clean-up!

11
00:00:57.478 --> 00:01:00.428
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

12
00:01:03.941 --> 00:01:07.974
Warning signs. Say it with me. Warning signs!

13
00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:21.878
Dengue is spread by the Aedes mosquito, which breeds in clean standing water. Communities can hold a clean-up to remove every breeding site and larvae. Anyone with fever and warning signs needs medical care.

14
00:01:21.928 --> 00:01:24.523
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:31.195
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.245 --> 00:01:32.438
Breeding site!

17
00:01:33.456 --> 00:01:38.537
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.587 --> 00:01:39.737
Fever!

19
00:01:40.507 --> 00:01:46.037
Did you know? The Aedes mosquito can breed in water as small as a bottle cap!

20
00:01:46.087 --> 00:01:47.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.487 --> 00:01:56.353
Think and answer. Where could dengue mosquitoes breed around your school?

22
00:01:56.403 --> 00:01:57.553
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.684 --> 00:02:03.585
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.635 --> 00:02:06.310
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

